        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4141737?u=25dd3f0d0b83d1d2767f18f8174addda8438e066&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Replaces the hand-written formal-definition table on the <code class=\"notranslate\">color-interpolation</code> page with <code class=\"notranslate\">{{CSSInfo}}</code>, now that mdn-data has the property (<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6411038217\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/data/issues/1121\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/data/pull/1121/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/data/pull/1121\">mdn/data#1121</a>, released in mdn-data 2.38.0).</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The hand-written table was wrong in two places:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Default value:</strong> it said <code class=\"notranslate\">auto</code>. The <a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/svgwg/svg2-draft/painting.html#ColorInterpolationProperty\" rel=\"nofollow\">SVG 2 definition</a> gives <code class=\"notranslate\">sRGB</code>, and so do Chromium (<code class=\"notranslate\">css_properties.json5</code>), Gecko (<code class=\"notranslate\">longhands.toml</code>) and WebKit (<code class=\"notranslate\">CSSProperties.json</code>). WPT's <code class=\"notranslate\">svg/painting/inheritance.svg</code> tests it. The page's own <code class=\"notranslate\">sRGB</code> entry already says it's the default.</li>\n<li><strong>Applies to:</strong> it listed only <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;linearGradient&gt;</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;radialGradient&gt;</code>. The spec says container elements, graphics elements, gradient elements, <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;use&gt;</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;animate&gt;</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">{{CSSInfo}}</code> also adds the rows the table didn't have, such as inherited, percentages and computed value.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Built the page locally with rari 1.3.0, which pulled mdn-data 2.38.0. The rendered table shows initial value <code class=\"notranslate\">sRGB</code>, applies to \"Container elements, graphics elements, gradient elements, <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;use&gt;</code>, and <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;animate&gt;</code> in <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;svg&gt;</code>\", inherited yes, computed value as specified, and animation type discrete.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6411038217\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/data/issues/1121\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/data/pull/1121/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/data/pull/1121\">mdn/data#1121</a> adds <code class=\"notranslate\">color-interpolation</code> to mdn-data.</li>\n</ul>",
