        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79165529?u=43a28f8bdde2a5d9ee9e0861d3d4ea22e7715ad8&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h2 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Add the reference page for the <code class=\"notranslate\">Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy-Report-Only</code> HTTP response header (<code class=\"notranslate\">files/en-us/web/http/reference/headers/cross-origin-opener-policy-report-only/index.md</code>), wired to <code class=\"notranslate\">browser-compat: http.headers.Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy-Report-Only</code>.</li>\n<li>Document its directives (<code class=\"notranslate\">unsafe-none</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">same-origin</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">same-origin-allow-popups</code>), the <code class=\"notranslate\">report-to</code> parameter, <code class=\"notranslate\">disposition: \"reporting\"</code> JSON report behavior, and note that <code class=\"notranslate\">noopener-allow-popups</code> applies only to the enforced header per the WHATWG HTML Standard (Section 7.1.3).</li>\n<li>Link <code class=\"notranslate\">Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy-Report-Only</code> from <code class=\"notranslate\">Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy</code> and list it under Security on the HTTP headers reference overview page.</li>\n<li>Add the <code class=\"notranslate\">coop</code> entry under reporting server endpoints on <code class=\"notranslate\">Web/API/Reporting_API</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Closes the missing reference documentation for <code class=\"notranslate\">Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy-Report-Only</code>, whose browser compatibility data (<code class=\"notranslate\">http/headers/Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy-Report-Only.json</code>) is already present in <code class=\"notranslate\">mdn/browser-compat-data</code>.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #39432.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3045492578\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39432\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/39432/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39432\">#39432</a></p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Verification</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Checked locally after final edits:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">node scripts/front-matter_linter.js</code> (0 errors)</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">npx markdownlint-cli2</code> (0 issues)</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">npx prettier --check</code> (passes)</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">npx cspell --no-progress --gitignore --config .vscode/cspell.json</code> (0 issues)</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">node --test</code> (27/27 passed)</li>\n</ul>",
