        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF161 adds support for the <code class=\"notranslate\">match-parent</code> value of <code class=\"notranslate\">quotes</code> in Nightly in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1752382\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1752382</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Adds an experimental features entry for <code class=\"notranslate\">quotes: match-parent</code> (<code class=\"notranslate\">layout.css.quotes.match-parent.enabled</code>).</li>\n<li>Adds it to the Firefox 161 experimental web features release notes.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The <code class=\"notranslate\">quotes#match-parent</code> links go to the value added in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6438779996\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46561\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/46561/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/46561\">#46561</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6311652878\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46460\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/46460/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46460\">#46460</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/46562",
            "title": "FF161 Relnote/ExprF: quotes: match-parent in Nightly",
            "date_modified": "2026-11-17T18:29:42.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-11-17T06:22:03.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "hamishwillee",
                "url": "https://github.com/hamishwillee"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF161 adds support for the <code class=\"notranslate\">match-parent</code> value of <code class=\"notranslate\">quotes</code> in Nightly in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1752382\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1752382</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This adds <code class=\"notranslate\">match-parent</code> to the <code class=\"notranslate\">quotes</code> page: the syntax, a value definition, and an example comparing <code class=\"notranslate\">auto</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">match-parent</code> for nested quotes in different languages, with and without custom quotation marks.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The spec still calls this value <code class=\"notranslate\">bikeshed-this</code>. The CSSWG resolved to name it <code class=\"notranslate\">match-parent</code> in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"687390650\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/5478\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/5478/hovercard?comment_id=6496640997&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/5478#issuecomment-6496640997\">w3c/csswg-drafts#5478 (comment)</a>, but the spec hasn't been updated yet, so the formal syntax shows <code class=\"notranslate\">bikeshed-this</code> for now.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">BCD in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6437584376\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/31166\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31166/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31166\">mdn/browser-compat-data#31166</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6311652878\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46460\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/46460/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46460\">#46460</a></p>",
